# AI-Generated Content & Code Disclosure Declaration

**Project Name:** STRATUM-4D  
**Event:** 2026 NASA Space Apps Challenge  
**Challenge:** Be An Earth System Trend Detective!  
**Live Deployment:** https://stratum-4d.vercel.app  
**Declaration Date:** November 15, 2026  

## 1. Executive Summary of AI Usage
In accordance with the NASA Space Apps Challenge Participant Terms and Conditions regarding AI-generated audio, code, or data, the **STRATUM-4D** team declares that **a majority of the source code in this repository was generated, scaffolded, and refactored using Large Language Models (LLMs), specifically Anthropic Claude and Google Gemini.** 

All domain formulation, statistical pipeline design, dataset selection, and scientific verification were performed by the human team. No NASA observational or reanalysis data was synthetically generated or altered by AI.

