## 3. Compliance & Scientific Integrity Statement
1. **No Synthetic Earth Science Data:** AI tools were strictly prohibited from fabricating, interpolating, or altering raw NASA Earth observation time series or statistical test outputs.
2. **Transparent UI Labeling:** Where mathematical models or illustrative proxies are used (such as the subsurface cutaway or post-2024 straight-line trend projections), they are explicitly labeled in the interface so users never confuse an illustration with a satellite measurement.
3. **Human Accountability:** Every module generated via Claude or Gemini was reviewed, integrated, tested, and validated by the team prior to deployment.
